OL,3,AChill to grip Bonfire Night as
OL,4,Atemperatures dip into single digits
OL,5,
OL,6,FDry but chilly weather is forecast this
OL,7,Fweek as millions plan to celebrate Guy
OL,8,FFawkes night on Thursday and the Hindu
OL,9,Ffestival of Diwali on 8 November.
OL,11,FFollowing the stormy end to October,
OL,12,Fhigh pressure has been building in and
OL,13,Fwill dominate for the rest of the week.
OL,15,FFor the vast majority of the UK, it
OL,16,Fwill be dry and settled by day with a
OL,17,Fmixture of cloud and some sunny spells.
OL,19,FBy night, temperatures will dip into
OL,20,Fthe single digits with the chance of
OL,21,Ffog developing in some areas.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
